    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

    `allowBackup="false"` in the manifest is the other half of this and stays:
    it stops cloud backup and nothing else. Device-to-device transfer is a
    separate mechanism with its own rules, and without them it carries this
    add-on's whole data directory, the library included, to the next phone,
    which must never happen.

    The whole directory rather than the store's own path: an acquired library is
    the only thing in it worth keeping, and it must not be transferred.
-->
<data-extraction-rules>
    <device-transfer>
        <exclude domain="file" path="." />
    </device-transfer>
</data-extraction-rules>
